---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import {
  PLAN_INTRO,
  PLAN_PATH,
  PLAN_TITLE,
  PROPERTIES,
} from "../config.ts";
---

<Base title={PLAN_TITLE} description={PLAN_INTRO.join(" ")} path={PLAN_PATH}>
  <article class="plan">
    <header class="plan__header">
      <h1 class="sr-only">The plan</h1>
      <div class="plan__intro">
        {PLAN_INTRO.map((paragraph) => <p>{paragraph}</p>)}
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="plan__section" aria-labelledby="system-heading">
      <h2 class="plan__heading" id="system-heading">The system</h2>
      <dl class="plan-register">
        {PROPERTIES.map((property) => (
          <div class="plan-register__row">
            <dt>{property.name}</dt>
            <dd>{property.description}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
      <div class="plan__copy plan__copy--after-register">
        <p>Signal and Skills keep us close to what is changing and what already works. The Harness makes the useful parts work inside startups. Use tells us where to go deeper.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plan__section" aria-labelledby="frontier-heading">
      <h2 class="plan__heading" id="frontier-heading">Stay close to the frontier</h2>
      <div class="plan__copy">
        <p><strong>Signal</strong> curates the articles, podcasts, research and tools worth following. <strong>Skills</strong> indexes the best agent skills for startup work: research, growth, hiring, fundraising and operations.</p>
        <p>Most of this is curation. We build our own where useful.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plan__section" aria-labelledby="context-heading">
      <h2 class="plan__heading" id="context-heading">Install the context</h2>
      <div class="plan__copy">
        <p>To do useful startup work, agents need to understand the startup they are working with.</p>
        <p>The <strong>Harness</strong> installs that context: strategy, customers, product, decisions, feedback and metrics. It also gives agents the tools, memory and permissions they need to act.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plan__section" aria-labelledby="use-heading">
      <h2 class="plan__heading" id="use-heading">Let use decide</h2>
      <div class="plan__copy">
        <p>Put the Skills and Harness to work with founders and early operators. See which workflows repeatedly create value.</p>
        <p>When one does, build an <strong>Agent</strong> around it. Then put it back into use and learn again.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plan__section" aria-labelledby="newsletter-heading">
      <h2 class="plan__heading" id="newsletter-heading">Share what we learn</h2>
      <div class="plan__copy">
        <p>The <strong>Newsletter</strong> is our direct channel to founders and early operators.</p>
        <p>Some become users. Their use and feedback shape what we build next.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
